# DCU-D1-16 REPORT.notification 单元测试与门禁记录

基于 `ed104b2b`（D1-18a/b/c、D1-19、D1-07 已合入），分支 `dcu/D1-16-report`。

```
$ ctest -R 'test_driver_dlt698|test_dcu_698_report' --output-on-failure
1/2 Test #27: test_dcu_698_report ..............   Passed
2/2 Test #85: test_driver_dlt698 ...............   Passed
100% tests passed, 0 tests failed out of 2

$ ctest --output-on-failure        # 全量（timeout 修正前，同一 D1-07 rebase 树）
100% tests passed, 0 tests failed out of 337

$ cmake -DENABLE_ASAN=ON ...; ctest -R 'test_driver_dlt698|test_dcu_698_report'
100% tests passed, 0 tests failed out of 2

$ python3 ci/scripts/run_fanalyzer.py --paths foundation/src/protocol,adapters/io_drivers/src,cmd/dcu,modules/edge_io/src,modules/edge_session/src
